{"id":"17c1d364fcf4fba1","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-query.md","title":"查询","display":"df-query — 查询","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-query","aliases":["29-df-query"],"display":"df-query — 查询","depends_on":["[[29-df-struc]]","[[29-df-vocab]]","[[29-df-isomorphism]]"],"revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29(2).zip修订；既有原书定位、日期和过往核对叙述作为继承记录，未重新取得或查看原书原件","revision_verification":"声明、类型、绑定、递归及书内链接审查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-query"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-query</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-query — 查询"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3a603dc4f41b07de\" href=\"?note=3a603dc4f41b07de\" title=\"29-df-isomorphism\">29-df-isomorphism</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29(2).zip修订；既有原书定位、日期和过往核对叙述作为继承记录，未重新取得或查看原书原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"声明、类型、绑定、递归及书内链接审查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\">\\(\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I:\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]\\to\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(I:\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]\\to\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N[X]\">\\(\\mathbb N[X]\\)</span> (primitive)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cong\">\\(\\cong\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3a603dc4f41b07de\" href=\"?note=3a603dc4f41b07de\" title=\"29-df-isomorphism\">29-df-isomorphism</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 是结构类之间的元语言全函数；每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 有唯一有限结构值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I(A)\">\\(I(A)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in\\mathrm{Query}[\\sigma,\\tau]\">\\(I\\in\\mathrm{Query}[\\sigma,\\tau]\\)</span> 是下式的性质模式，不断言全部类函数组成集合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N[X]\">\\(\\mathbb N[X]\\)</span> 表示有限次、非负整数系数的一元多项式；同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 必须适用于全部输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"I\\in\\mathrm{Query}[\\sigma,\\tau]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ I:\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]\\to\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\ \\land\\ (\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N[X])(\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma])\\ \\operatorname{card}(|I(A)|)\\leq p(\\operatorname{card}(|A|))\\ \\land\\ (\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma])\\bigl(A\\cong B\\Rightarrow I(A)\\cong I(B)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[I\\in\\mathrm{Query}[\\sigma,\\tau]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ I:\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]\\to\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\ \\land\\ (\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N[X])(\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma])\\ \\operatorname{card}(|I(A)|)\\leq p(\\operatorname{card}(|A|))\\ \\land\\ (\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma])\\bigl(A\\cong B\\Rightarrow I(A)\\cong I(B)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>多项式界对所有输入统一；同构输入要求同构输出，而不是要求所选输出载集字面相等。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-struc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-vocab","status":"resolved","id":"28e86a5f0243a0ae","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-vocab]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"3a603dc4f41b07de","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-vocab","status":"resolved","id":"28e86a5f0243a0ae","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}$ (see [[29-df-vocab]])","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$I:\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]\\to\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]$ (see [[29-df-struc]])","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"3a603dc4f41b07de","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\cong$ (see [[29-df-isomorphism]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}","display":false},{"tex":"I:\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]\\to\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N[X]","display":false},{"tex":"\\cong","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"I(A)","display":false},{"tex":"I\\in\\mathrm{Query}[\\sigma,\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N[X]","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"I\\in\\mathrm{Query}[\\sigma,\\tau]\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ I:\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma]\\to\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\ \\land\\ (\\exists p\\in\\mathbb N[X])(\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma])\\ \\operatorname{card}(|I(A)|)\\leq p(\\operatorname{card}(|A|))\\ \\land\\ (\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\sigma])\\bigl(A\\cong B\\Rightarrow I(A)\\cong I(B)\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1567,"backlinks":[{"id":"2005f7c77a4cbc08","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-20","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[29-df-query]]、[[29-df-bool-query]] — 同构封闭查询与布尔查询"},{"id":"b24f25338d17d661","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d91cca50bc997dfa","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"805a7de3b1249a36","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-query]]"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-118","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-query]]"}],"outgoing":["4de8e0c8085801f5","28e86a5f0243a0ae","3a603dc4f41b07de"]}